# Regenerable outputs. Every figure here is rebuilt from notes/data/*.tsv by a
# script listed in notes/PROVENANCE.md, so the PNG/PDF/SVG themselves are not
# worth 260 MB of history. The source-data TSVs *are* tracked.
notes/figures/
notes/paper/

# ...with one exception. The figures actually submitted are tracked, because
# "regenerable from notes/data" is only true of the CURRENT code, and a year
# from now the useful question is what the paper showed, not what the scripts
# would now produce. Everything else under notes/figures/ stays ignored.
!notes/figures/figure2_new.pdf
!notes/figures/fig3_probit.pdf
!notes/figures/fig4_stage.pdf
!notes/figures/fig5_pmc_mechanism.pdf
!notes/figures/fig6_brain_behavior.pdf
!notes/figures/SUPP_S1_probit_by_stake.pdf
!notes/figures/SUPP_S2_model_comparison.pdf
!notes/figures/SUPP_S3_ppc_design_grid.pdf
!notes/figures/SUPP_S4_noise_flexibility.pdf
._*
